Server init.

>> message := ['this is a string to be encrypted!'].
>> key := ['secret123!'].
>> vault := Valv ny: ['myvault'].

>> encrypted := vault kryptera: message nyckel: key.
>> decrypted := vault dekryptera: encrypted nyckel: key.

Utdata 
skriv: ['Message:'], stop
skriv: message, stop
skriv: ['Decrypted:'], stop
skriv: decrypted, stop.
